# NOTICE

**scoretk** is a score conversion toolkit. Its first
converter, **scoretk-core**, is a Rust port of MusicXML export and of the
score readers (`.mscx` / `.mscz`, 3.x and 4.x/5.x formats) of
**MuseScore Studio**. The crates `scoretk-midi-common`, `scoretk-midi-import`
and `scoretk-midi-export` port its SMF format, its MIDI import (reading an
SMF into the model), its MIDI export and repeat unfolding
(`RepeatList`). The `scoretk-mei-{common,import,export}` crates port the MEI
module of MuseScore **4.7.4** (tag `v4.7.4`, commit
`7688c005ad963ba09ee715aae53dbc7e8c9d5ef8`); the MEI 5.1 format reference is
the RelaxNG schema `mei-all-5.1.rng` (ECL-2.0, GPL-3 compatible), part of the
MEI 5.1 specification at <https://music-encoding.org>. This file summarises the origin of the
code and data, the corresponding licences and the trademarks.

