### Test corpus

- `tests/corpus/v3/*.mscx` and `tests/corpus/v4/*.mscx`: test scores
  copied as-is from MuseScore Studio (same commit as above),
  mainly `src/engraving/tests/**` and
  `src/importexport/musicxml/tests/data/`. Licence GPL-3.0, Copyright (C)
  MuseScore Limited and others. The file-by-file detail is in
  [`tests/corpus/SOURCES.md`](tests/corpus/SOURCES.md).
- `tests/corpus/**/*.ref.musicxml`: references produced locally by
  `scripts/gen-references.sh` with **MuseScore 4.7.4** (nixpkgs package), run
  in headless mode. These are outputs of the MuseScore program, covered by
  the same licence.
- `tests/corpus/midi/**/*.ref.mid`: MIDI references produced locally by
  `scripts/gen-midi-references.sh` with the same version of MuseScore. Same
  licence.
- `tests/corpus/midi/import/**/*.ref.musicxml`: MIDI import
  references produced locally by `scripts/gen-midi-import-references.sh` (MuseScore
