  the project, licence GPL-3.0-only.
- `tests/corpus/abc/**/*.abc`: snapshots of the output of `scoretk-abc-export`
  on the corpus, produced by the crate itself (command
  `UPDATE_ABC_SNAPSHOTS=1 cargo test -p scoretk --test abc_corpus`).
  Work of the project, licence GPL-3.0-only.
- `tests/corpus/ly/alde-friezen/`: the three source files
  (`partituer.ly`, `fideo.ly`, `noaten.ily`) of *De âlde Friezen*,
  <https://github.com/MacLotsen/alde-friezen>, commit
  `bba32e7492d2bfe581b15b5d82179db132937702`, used to test folder-wide
  `\include` resolution. Licence **CC0-1.0** (full text in that directory's
